<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria has confirmed sending troops to Saudi Arabia to support the Saudi war against the Houthis while publicly denying any Syrian presence in Yemen. Syrian security forces killed a former aide to an Assad-era military commander in a clash in western Syria. The Syrian government and Jordan have signed cooperation deals as they seek to mend ties after recent deadly airstrikes. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/10/world/middleeast/syria-weighs-sending-troops-to-aid-saudi-war-with-houthis.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNdkdRX3ZKb0hFX0EtM25yamlZYWJ3dVh4UlZJelZWMmpSOVlSR3dzdVg1TEFoNmJoZFM4Q2dDeUtkQ1RCYWs1cFNsRlctRl9XeEF2VzM0N29BRzBMMlVhUVBEQmdHV0hwand0N0xGQ2JKZE0tR0NYaS1yRzBqN1JxcDg1ckxhRm96SThIeGVYcUlOY1ZLWVl3UG9senBxOGtOdk11TlMwT2haVEdoa1hvYXIwZjhZZXJCZkVmYUtfay1oS3lnOFJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOQXNnSzJ5WnREOUsyUjFpSzNLYVBJcE5Jc0JhRzJyZ1Z5Mi00LXptUFRqWjlCN1lpN241WVFVQWJ3Zlo0RXVDbXczdlNhbE1WWjdrRVJPU25PWUpvN1VpWDNaWUhieFQzaVBneVI4RlEzSC0xSGctMjBUbld4eG9zWFVfU25NcWpwVjlvQjkwTTZsWUJPSTNNcWFKR2d2cXNydERXd19GSXBpUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;finchannel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPQXI4SnVWZG9OQndqcTFaRHFPempXTE1BUUtvQjQwZGJaa19fd0dPV2NWMlhFTmhBbFAzQTFabDc4NXJ6WG5HTEZIRUkyUS12alR4SDBuMXNEMDZjWVlDSllmTnJ6OUppSnd1YnpMQnhsUGo4QjhxR193TUc1LW05ejVWd1MxZkFpU25pUm9PN0F3SkU?oc=5&quot;&gt;ANHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMib0FVX3lxTE9QTU9oSmw2aE9lVFdjYm5XZT